  "universal_guidelines": [
    "Avoid 'AI slop' aesthetic (generic centered layouts, uniform styling).",
    "Create depth through layered design elements with z-index hierarchy.",
    "Use glass-morphism effects with backdrop filters (12-24px blur) for overlays.",
    "DO NOT apply universal transition (transition: all). Animate specific properties.",
    "DO NOT center align the app container.",
    "Use modern button styles (pill-shaped or sharp) with interaction animations.",
    "NEVER use AI assistant Emoji characters for icons.",
    "Every interaction needs micro-animations (hover, focus, active).",
    "Use 2-3x more spacing than feels comfortable for layout containers, but keep data dense.",
    "Subtle grain textures or noise overlays are encouraged for backgrounds.",
    "Prioritize using pre-existing components from src/components/ui.",
    "Components MUST use named exports.",
    "Pages MUST use default exports.",
    "Use 'sonner' for toasts.",
    "All interactive elements MUST include data-testid attribute."
  ],
  "instructions_to_main_agent": "You are building a high-fidelity, production-ready chat application. Focus on the 'feel' of the application. It should feel snappy, responsive, and premium. Use the provided color palette and typography strictly. Implement the sidebar with a collapsible feature. Ensure the message list handles scroll correctly and stays pinned to the bottom when new messages arrive. Use the provided avatar URLs for user profiles. Implement a proper dark/light mode toggle using Tailwind's 'dark' class."
}